msgstr "生成された API キーをコピーして上の欄に貼り付けます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:301
msgid "Requires a paid OpenAI account with available credits."
msgstr "利用可能なクレジットがある有料 OpenAI アカウントが必要です。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:304
msgid "Claude (Anthropic)"
msgstr "Claude (Anthropic)"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:305
msgid "Claude Sonnet, Opus, Haiku and more"
msgstr "Claude Sonnet、Opus、Haiku など"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:309
msgid "Visit https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys"
msgstr "https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys にアクセスします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:310
msgid "Sign in or create an Anthropic account"
msgstr "Anthropic アカウントにサインイン、または新規作成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:311
msgid "Navigate to the API keys section"
msgstr "API キーのセクションへ移動します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:312
msgid "Generate a new API key"
msgstr "新しい API キーを生成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:313
#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:341
msgid "Copy and paste the key above"
msgstr "キーをコピーして上の欄に貼り付けます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:315
msgid "Claude Sonnet is usually the best balance of performance and cost. You can also use the Anthropic Models API to inspect currently available model IDs."
msgstr "Claude Sonnet は通常、性能とコストのバランスが良好です。現在利用可能なモデル ID は Anthropic Models API でも確認できます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:424
msgid "GitHub Models"
msgstr "GitHub Models"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:425
msgid "GitHub Models API with a token that has models:read permission"
msgstr "models:read 権限付きトークンで利用する GitHub Models API"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:323
msgid "Visit https://github.com/settings/tokens"
msgstr "https://github.com/settings/tokens にアクセスします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:431
msgid "Create a fine-grained personal access token or a token that supports the models:read permission"
msgstr "fine-grained personal access token、または models:read 権限を持てるトークンを作成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:432
msgid "Grant the token the \"models:read\" permission"
msgstr "そのトークンに「models:read」権限を付与します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:326
msgid "Generate and copy the token"
msgstr "トークンを生成してコピーします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:327
msgid "Paste it above as your API key"
msgstr "API キーとして上の欄に貼り付けます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:436
msgid "Use GitHub Models for external API access. Personal access tokens are not supported on the internal Copilot endpoint. For Japanese site content, a multilingual model such as openai/gpt-4.1 is recommended over openai/gpt-5-nano."
msgstr "外部 API アクセスには GitHub Models を使用してください。個人アクセストークンは内部 Copilot エンドポイントでは利用できません。日本語のサイト内容では、openai/gpt-5-nano より openai/gpt-4.1 のような多言語モデルを推奨します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:332
msgid "Google Gemini"
msgstr "Google Gemini"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:333
msgid "Gemini 2.5 Flash, Gemini 2.5 Pro and more"
msgstr "Gemini 2.5 Flash、Gemini 2.5 Pro など"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:337
msgid "Go to https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey"
msgstr "https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey にアクセスします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:338
msgid "Click \"Get API key\""
msgstr "「Get API key」をクリックします。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:339
msgid "Create a new project or select an existing one"
msgstr "新しいプロジェクトを作成するか、既存のプロジェクトを選択します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:340
msgid "Generate an API key for use in the application"
msgstr "このアプリケーション用の API キーを生成します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:343
msgid "Use a current stable Gemini model such as gemini-2.5-flash. Older Gemini 2.0 model IDs are being deprecated."
msgstr "gemini-2.5-flash のような現在の安定版 Gemini モデルを使用してください。古い Gemini 2.0 系のモデル ID は非推奨化が進んでいます。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:384
msgid "Too many requests. Please wait a moment and try again."
msgstr "リクエストが多すぎます。少し待ってから再度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:395
msgid "Please enter a question."
msgstr "質問を入力してください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:420
msgid "Ask about this site"
msgstr "このサイトについて質問する"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:421
msgid "Hi, ask me about this site and I will search the content for you."
msgstr "こんにちは。このサイトについて質問してください。関連する内容を検索してご案内します。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:433
msgid "Thinking..."
msgstr "回答を生成中..."

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:434
msgid "Sources"
msgstr "参照元"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:435
msgid "The chatbot is temporarily unavailable. Please try again later."
msgstr "チャットボットは一時的に利用できません。しばらくしてから再度お試しください。"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:439
msgid "Site Assistant"
msgstr "サイトアシスタント"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:442
msgid "Chat messages"
msgstr "チャットメッセージ"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:444
msgid "Your question"
msgstr "質問内容"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:445
msgid "Ask a question about products, services, or help pages..."
msgstr "製品、サービス、ヘルプページについて質問してください..."

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:446
msgid "Send"
msgstr "送信"

#: includes/class-ai-site-search-chatbot.php:1056
